<title>RUSSIA: Russian Inkombank 96 pre-tax rises to 749 bln rbls.</title>
<headline>Russian Inkombank 96 pre-tax rises to 749 bln rbls.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pre-tax profit at one of Russia's largest banks, AB Inkombank, rose to 749.27 billion roubles in 1996 from 740.63 billion in 1995, both according to Russian standards, the bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>KPMG audited the figures, which Inkombank spokesman Ilya Yakushev said were prepared according to Russian central bank standards.</p>
<p>Accounts prepared to international standards would be available later this month, he said.</p>
<p>					  Year ended December 31</p>
<p>    (billion roubles)		1996		1995</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		   749.3	     740.6</p>
<p>    Assets			  16,125.3	  12,836.0</p>
<p>    Shareholders' funds	  1,974.0	   1,400.1</p>
<p>($1 = 5,727 roubles)</p>
<p>--Alexei Pankratov, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
